{"ID":"20240515131452-88kq63y","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131452-88kq63y","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131452-88kq63y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132449-0v30wgs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132449-0v30wgs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132449-0v30wgs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:395,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:395\u0026#125;","title":"007","type":"doc","updated":"20240515132449"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515132449-0v30wgs","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 926px;","id":"20240515132449-0v30wgs","updated":"20240515132449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"BR"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"45 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/11"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：病人為心瓣膜閉鎖不全之人，因下周要登20000尺之高山，擔心無法呼吸。因掃地在右腎俞處背痛約一周。自述服前方後左側已好許多。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n胃中有嘔心感。\n略有心悸。\n壓力大，服前方後好許多\n睡好\n大便時每日一次，時隔日\n胃口還好\n口渴喜溫水\n雙足冷晚上睡時，時冷時熱，更年期身熱。\n手涼額溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈弦(師曰:有水)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃濕\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方： 中脘，足三里，左臨泣，束骨，後溪"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n半夏三錢，生薑兩片，茯苓四錢，桂枝五錢，炙甘草五錢，大棗十枚，瓜蔞實三錢，枳實三錢，薤白三錢，遠志三錢，補骨脂三錢，澤瀉三錢，柴胡三錢，玉金五錢，龍膽草三錢，黃芩三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n小半夏湯去水，桂枝甘草湯去心悸，枳實薤白瓜蔞實治心臟瓣膜閉鎖不全(心氣問題)。柴胡，玉金，龍膽草，黃芩疏肝，木生火，強心。\n中脘穴引水往下，足三里去胃中之冷水，足臨泣去帶脈上之痛，束骨瀉膀胱經之實症，後溪治督脈上之痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}